 "method": "Best-estimate transport and dosimetry values for a Co-60-like spectrum in water. Primary fluence is normalized to the unattenuated central-axis fluence; scatter, charged-particle transport, spectra, and dose quantities are approximate rather than Monte Carlo results. Kerma was estimated from water energy-transfer coefficients, dose from near charged-particle equilibrium at 5 cm, and PDD from typical 10 cm \u00d7 10 cm Co-60 depth-dose behavior. Spectra and angular distributions are approximate bin-integrated estimates.",
